                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24440: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Mexicali</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Boyle</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7,
                        1920</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your August 6th.</p>
                <p>Notify Goree, as under instructions from the Department, that, unless his border
                    permit is returned to Permit Agent at Calexico within 24 hours, instructions for
                    its cancellation will be issued. Furthermore, that his re-entry into United
                    States will not be allowed except on a regular passport issued by Department.
                    Advise Permit Agent.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
